        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo me kaka pa Reuben ki pa Gad gubedo ki lwak lim makwo mapol twatwal. Ka guneno lobo Jajer ki lobo Gilead obedo lobo maber twatwal me kwat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci gucito bot Moses ki ajwaka Eleajar ki bot lutel wi lwak, guwaco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gaŋi magi, Atarot, Dibon, Jajer, Nimra, Kecbon, Eleale, Cebam, Nebo ki Beon ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma i lobo ma yam Rwot oloyo i nyim lwak jo Icrael, lobogi ber twatwal me kwat; ci wan luticwu-ni watye ki lim madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka in bene ipwoyo tamwa-ni, ci iye lobo man gimi botwa obed mewa, pe doŋ iterwa waŋol loka Jordan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Moses owaco bot jo pa Gad ki pa Reuben ni, “Omegiwu gibicito ka lweny kun wun wubedo kany bo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŋo wumito balo cwiny jo Icrael, ni pe gucit loka ca i lobo ma yam Rwot omiyo botgi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30+NUM.13.31+NUM.13.32+NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 13.17-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwarowu bene yam koŋ gutimo kit meno i kare ma acwalogi ki i Kadec-bamea pi neno lobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ka gucito malo wa i nota me Ecikol, ka guneno lobo, ci gubalo cwiny jo Icrael woko, ni pe gucit i lobo ma Rwot doŋ otyeko miyo botgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 14.26-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci kiniga omako Rwot i komgi i nino maca. Okwono kwon kun waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ada, pe tye ŋat mo ki i kin jo ma yam gua ki i Ejipt, cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyeraryo dok kwede malo ma bineno lobo ma yam akwoŋo pire ni abimiyo bot Abraim ki Icaka ki Yakobo, pien pe gubedo ka lubo gin ma amito ducu kakare, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe tye ŋat mo ma bineno, kono nyo Kaleb wod pa Jepune ma jo Keniji, ki Yocwa wod pa Nun, pien gin aye gubedo ka lubo gin ma amito ducu kakare.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiniga omako Rwot i kom jo Icrael i kare ca, ci omiyo gubedo ka wirre i tim atata gutyeko mwaka pyeraŋwen kulu, nio ka yalwak ma yam gutimo rac i nyim Rwot gutum woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci nen, wun bene dok wua malo kun wuleyo ka wegiwu, wun litino pa lubalo, miyo wubimedo dok kiniga pa Rwot doko mager t kom jo Icrael! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ka wuweko luba gin ma en mito kombeddi, ci en dok bitenyo lwak man woko i tim ata; kit meno wubimiyo lwak man ducu to tum woko.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gin dok gubino bote kun giwaco ni, “Wabigero dwol ma wagero ki gweŋ pi romiwa, ki gaŋi pi mon ki litinowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wan wabiruko jami Iwenywa, kun wayubbe pi telo wi jo Icrael anyim, nio ka wabiterogi i kabedogi, kun noŋo monwa ki litinowa gibedo i gaŋi gogo ma wacelo matek pi dano ma gibedo i lobo-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wabidwogo i pacowa nio waŋ ma jo Icrael gutyeko noŋo ginaleyagi ki acel acel ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wan pe wabinywako leyo lobo kacel kwedgi i ne kulu Jordan ki tuŋ kunnu ducu, pien ginaleya ma me wa doŋ watyeko noŋone i loka Jordan kany ma tuŋ wokceŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo Moses dok owaco botgi ni, “Ka ce wubitimo kit meno, ka ce wubiruko jami Lwenywu wucito anyim ka lweny i nyim Rwot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun dano acel acel i kinwu ma romo lweny kato loka Jordan i nyim Rwot, nio ka Rwot otyeko ryemo lumerokke woko ki i nyime, ci ber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Rwot doŋ otyeko loyo lobo-nu, ci lacen wubidwogo giwu kun banya mo pe i komwu bot Rwot nyo bot jo Icrael, ci lobo man wubicamo bedo mewu i nyim Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka pe wutimo kit meno, ci nen, noŋo wutimo bal i kom Rwot. Myero wune ni, balwu bimiyo wutiŋo alii ma bidwarowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuger gaŋi pi mon ki Litinowu, ki dwol pi romiwu; ento wucob gin ma wuwaco-ni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Gad ki jo Reuben gudok iye bot Moses ni, “Wan aye luticci; wabitiyo kit macalo in laditwa iciko ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Litinowa ki monwa ki romiwa ki limwa makwo ducu gibidoŋ kany i gaŋi ma i Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wan ducu ma waruko jami lweny wabikato waŋolo loka ca ka lweny i nyim Rwot kit macalo in laditwa iciko-ni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
